OL,3,GNEWSA'I want to keep classical Indian
OL,4,Adance alive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dancer who opened a school in Preston
OL,7,Fsays she wants to help keep traditional
OL,8,FIndian classical dance alive in the UK.
OL,10,FSruthy Mahima Sanalkumar, 28, grew up
OL,11,Fin Kerala, South India, and began
OL,12,Ftraining aged nine in the classical
OL,13,Fdance styles Bharatanatyam,
OL,14,FMohiniyattam and Kuchipudi.
OL,16,FAfter moving to Lancashire four years
OL,17,Fago to study, she continued performing
OL,18,Fand established the Omkaram School of
OL,19,FDance.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
